OL,3,GNEWSASecond seabird blown 100 miles off
OL,4,Acourse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Manx shearwater has become the second
OL,7,Fseabird in a year to be found in
OL,8,FHerefordshire after apparently being
OL,9,Fblown about 109 miles (175km) off
OL,10,Fcourse from the Welsh coast.
OL,12,FIts arrival comes a year after a
OL,13,Fpuffin, also thought to have come from
OL,14,FSkomer Island, was found in a garden
OL,15,Fnear Stoke Lacy.
OL,17,FElliot Goodwin, from Vets for Pets in
OL,18,FHereford, described the Manx shearwater
OL,19,Fas a "remarkable species".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
