OL,3,GNEWSASecond seabird blown 100 miles off
OL,4,Acourse
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the bird's "highly unusual"
OL,7,Fappearance in the county was likely
OL,8,Fcaused by inexperience and strong
OL,9,Fsouth-westerly winds.
